{"seq":3,"slug":"clv-cross-border-adjust","title":"跨境多币种与获客成本调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/clv-modeling/clv-cross-border-adjust","wordCount":2945,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境多币种与获客成本调整\">跨境多币种与获客成本调整</h1><p>一个在德国和巴西同时卖货的平台，如果直接用「预测购买次数 × 平均客单价」，会得出一个笃定的错误结论：巴西客户的 CLV 是德国客户的 1.6 倍。这个结论来自三个叠加的口径错误——巴西的雷亚尔计价数字更高（汇率错觉）、巴西的退货与逆向物流成本更高（贡献侵蚀）、巴西的获客成本只有德国的三分之一（投入端差异）。前两个错误让分子虚高，第三个错误被完全忽略。本文处理的就是这三件事，它是本章唯一无法从通用 CLV 教材里抄到的一篇，也是前两篇结论能否在管理会上站住的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-跨境-clv-的三个修正层\">核心概念：跨境 CLV 的三个修正层</h2><p>通用 CLV 公式假设「同一平台、同一币种、同一成本结构」，跨境场景下这三个假设全部不成立。修正必须分层做，且顺序不能乱——先修正确认口径（分子），再修正投入口径（分母），最后才是跨市场可比性（对标）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始预测 CLV&lt;br/&gt;本币计价] --&gt; B[第一层: 币种归一]&#10;  B --&gt; C[统一基准币种]&#10;  C --&gt; D[第二层: 成本侵蚀修正]&#10;  D --&gt; E[扣退货 / 逆向物流 / 关税 / VAT]&#10;  E --&gt; F[净贡献 CLV]&#10;  G[获客成本 CAC&lt;br/&gt;分市场分渠道] --&gt; H[第三层: 分母构造]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[LTV/CAC 与回收期]&#10;  I --&gt; J{回收期 &lt;= 目标?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[可放量]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[收紧出价或退出市场]\">graph TD\n  A[原始预测 CLV&lt;br/&gt;本币计价] --&gt; B[第一层: 币种归一]\n  B --&gt; C[统一基准币种]\n  C --&gt; D[第二层: 成本侵蚀修正]\n  D --&gt; E[扣退货 / 逆向物流 / 关税 / VAT]\n  E --&gt; F[净贡献 CLV]\n  G[获客成本 CAC&lt;br/&gt;分市场分渠道] --&gt; H[第三层: 分母构造]\n  F --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[LTV/CAC 与回收期]\n  I --&gt; J{回收期 &lt;= 目标?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[可放量]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[收紧出价或退出市场]</pre><p>三层的关系是：币种归一让数字可比，成本修正让数字真实，分母构造让数字可决策。跳过任何一层，结论都会在某个环节被推翻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一层-币种归一的时点与类型选择\">第一层：币种归一的时点与类型选择</h2><p>跨币种聚合的正确性几乎完全取决于「用哪个汇率、在哪一天用」。同一份数据用不同汇率口径可以产生 5–15% 的差异，在低毛利品类里这个量级足以改变「该不该投放」的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>汇率类型</th>\n<th>取值来源</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>混用后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即期汇率 spot</td>\n<td>市场实时报价</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>实时出价、当日结算</td>\n<td>历史报表不可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日终中间价 daily fix</td>\n<td>央行/权威源公布</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>管理报表、模型标签</td>\n<td>与真实成交略有偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算汇率 budget rate</td>\n<td>期初锁定</td>\n<td>季度/年度</td>\n<td>预算编制、目标设定</td>\n<td>掩盖真实经营差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算汇率 settlement</td>\n<td>实际结汇成交价</td>\n<td>每次结汇</td>\n<td>财务入账</td>\n<td>滞后，不适合决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>硬规则：模型标签与管理报表必须使用日终中间价，逐笔按发生日折算（transaction-date rate）。</strong> 这条规则的理由与全球营销预算与 ROI 管控平台的口径约定完全一致：用即期汇率意味着 8 月的报表在 9 月重跑会得出不同数字，所有对话都会退化成「为什么数变了」；用预算汇率则会让管理层看不见真实的汇率影响。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>CLV</mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mfrac><msub><mtext>margin</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLV}^{\\text{base}}_i = \\sum_{t \\in T_i} \\frac{\\text{margin}_{i,t}}{\\text{rate}(t,\\, c_i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1693em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8325em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4381em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7702em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">margin</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是客户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的结算币种。全部金额以<strong>整数最小单位</strong>存储（ISO 4217 的 exponent 决定小数位；JPY/KRW 为 0 位，USD/EUR/CNY 为 2 位），绝不用浮点——多币种聚合下的浮点舍入误差会累积成对不上账的偏差。</p>\n<p>还有一个容易忽略的细节：<strong>客户的结算币种不等于他的市场币种</strong>。一个用美元信用卡在德国站购物的美国用户，其订单以 EUR 计价但实际以 USD 结算，退款时的汇率与下单时不同，会产生 1–3% 的汇兑损益。这个损益应当作为独立的成本项显式记录，而不是被摊进商品成本里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第二层-成本侵蚀修正-跨境-clv-与本土-clv-最大的区别\">第二层：成本侵蚀修正——跨境 CLV 与本土 CLV 最大的区别</h2><p>跨境场景下，从 GMV 到净贡献之间横着四道侵蚀，每一道的市场差异都远大于商品毛利本身的差异。</p>\n<p><strong>侵蚀一：退货与逆向物流。</strong> 服装、鞋类的跨境退货率普遍显著高于本土（尺码预期落差 + 试穿成本降低），跨境退货的逆向物流成本又可能接近正向物流的两倍，且部分市场的退货商品无法二次销售（清关与检疫）。因此退货对 CLV 的影响是<strong>双重</strong>的：损失收入，同时产生额外成本。正确的处理是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>net margin</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>COGS</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>salvage</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>ship</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>ship_rev</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net margin}_{i,t} = (\\text{GMV}_{i,t} - \\text{COGS}) \\cdot (1 - \\rho_{i}) - \\text{GMV}_{i,t} \\cdot \\rho_i \\cdot (1 - r_{\\text{salvage}}) - \\text{ship}_{i,t} - \\text{ship\\_rev}_{i,t} \\cdot \\rho_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0481em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net margin</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COGS</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">salvage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ship</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1902em;vertical-align:-0.4958em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ship_rev</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4958em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该客户的实际退货率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>salvage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{salvage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">salvage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是退货商品的残值回收率（能二次销售的比例）。注意退货率必须<strong>按客户建模</strong>而不是按市场取均值——高频退货客户与从不退货客户的价值差异，往往比市场之间的差异更大。</p>\n<p><strong>侵蚀二：关税与进口增值税。</strong> DDP（完税后交货）模式下，平台或卖家承担进口关税与 VAT，这部分直接减少边际贡献；DDU 模式下由消费者承担（但通常表现为转化率下降，是隐性成本）。跨境卖家在选择 DDP/DDU 时实质上是在「显性成本」与「隐性转化损失」之间取舍，而对 CLV 建模而言，DDP 下必须把关税与 VAT 计入扣除项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>tariff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>HS</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>dest</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>VAT</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>dest</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>category</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{duty}_{i,t} = \\text{GMV}_{i,t} \\cdot \\tau_{\\text{tariff}}(\\text{HS}, \\text{dest}) + \\text{GMV}_{i,t} \\cdot \\tau_{\\text{VAT}}(\\text{dest}, \\text{category})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tariff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HS</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dest</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VAT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dest</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>HS 编码归类、自贸协定下的优惠税率、欧盟 IOSS 的简化申报都会影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值，具体归类与税率体系属于 HS 编码归类与关税引擎、全球税务与发票引擎的范围。建模时不需要精确到每个 SKU 的税率，但必须按品类区分——3C 配件与服装的关税率可以相差两三倍。</p>\n<p><strong>侵蚀三：支付成本与外汇成本。</strong> 跨境支付的费率显著高于本币收单（本地钱包除外），且涉及两次换汇的路径会有额外点数损耗。这部分与支付通道选择强相关，本地化支付覆盖与通道成本属于本地支付与钱包工程的范围。</p>\n<p><strong>侵蚀四：履约时效带来的隐性折损。</strong> 长时效履约市场的客户首单满意度低、复购率低，这是影响未来频次的结构性因素而非单次成本。建模时它不需要显式扣减，但会体现在该市场客户的留存曲线参数里（见 <a href=\"clv-model-method\">BG/NBD、概率模型与 ML 预测</a> 的分市场参数估计）。</p>\n<p>四道侵蚀叠加后的效果是：<strong>同一个商品在不同市场的净贡献率可能相差一倍以上</strong>。下表给出一个示意性的对照结构（比例仅为量级示意，实际必须用自己的数据计算）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>市场</th>\n<th>GMV 基准</th>\n<th>退货率量级</th>\n<th>关税/VAT 侵蚀</th>\n<th>支付费率</th>\n<th>净贡献率量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>德国（本土邻近）</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>含 VAT 但可抵扣</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>de minimis 内可免</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴西</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>高（历史关税率高）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印尼</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中（低值免税额度）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（表中「净贡献率」= 扣除四道侵蚀后的贡献边际 / GMV，仅示意排序关系。）</p>\n<h2 id=\"第三层-分市场-cac-与回收期\">第三层：分市场 CAC 与回收期</h2><p>分子修正完后，必须构造分母。这里最常见的两个错误是「用全站平均 CAC」和「用首次订单的 CPA 代替 CAC」。前者抹掉渠道与市场差异（一个靠自然搜索获客的德国客户和一个靠付费社媒获客的巴西客户，成本可以差五倍），后者忽略了部分客户会重复购买——首次订单 CPA 是获客的即时成本，而 CAC 才是应当与 CLV 比较的那个量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mrow><mtext>market</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>channel</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>spend</mtext><mrow><mtext>market</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>channel</mtext></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>new customers acquired</mtext><mrow><mtext>market</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>channel</mtext></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_{\\text{market}, \\text{channel}} = \\frac{\\text{spend}_{\\text{market}, \\text{channel}}}{\\text{new customers acquired}_{\\text{market}, \\text{channel}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5309em;vertical-align:-1.0662em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4647em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">new customers acquired</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7702em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">spend</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0662em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这里必须用<strong>新客数</strong>而不是订单数，且新客定义要与第二章的阶段定义一致（见 <a href=\"../lifecycle-stage/stage-definition\">新客/成长/成熟/衰退/流失划分</a>），否则分母会因为定义漂移而不可比。归因模型的选择会影响分子在不同渠道之间的分配，这属于增长归因系统的范围，本处只取它的输出作为 CAC 输入。</p>\n<p>构造完成后得到三个决策指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LTV/CAC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mtext>CLV</mtext><mtext>market</mtext><mtext>net, discounted</mtext></msubsup><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>market</mtext></msub></mfrac><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Payback</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>:</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><msub><mtext>margin</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mtext>CAC</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LTV/CAC} = \\frac{\\text{CLV}^{\\text{net, discounted}}_{\\text{market}}}{\\text{CAC}_{\\text{market}}} \\qquad \\text{Payback} = \\min\\left\\{ N : \\sum_{n \\le N} \\frac{\\text{margin}_n}{(1+d)^n} \\ge \\text{CAC} \\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV/CAC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4943em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6913em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net, discounted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Payback</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1395em;vertical-align:-1.3895em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3895em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3449em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">margin</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>LTV/CAC 是给战略看的（要不要进这个市场），回收期是给现金流看的（这个市场什么时候能自我造血）。</strong> 两者会给出不同答案：一个高 LTV/CAC 但回收期 18 个月的市场，在现金流紧张时不应该做，因为它占用的资金会被长期锁住。跨境业务的现金周期本身比本土更长（货款在途、平台放款周期、清关税费垫付），因此回收期的容忍度应当比本土业务更保守。</p>\n<p>一个实操上的折现率约定：<strong>内部决策用加权平均资本成本（WACC）量级（常见 8–12%），跨市场比较时全市场统一使用同一个折现率</strong>。给高风险市场单独提高折现率在理论上更严谨，但会引入主观性并让对标失去可比性，折中的做法是主口径统一、风险调整作为敏感性分析的旁路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨市场对标的可行做法\">跨市场对标的可行做法</h2><p>有了统一口径的净贡献 CLV 与 CAC，跨市场对标才成为可能。但对标很容易变成「谁的数大谁更好」的粗暴比较，实际上应当看三个不同的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对标问题</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>决策含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>这个市场值得进吗</td>\n<td>市场层 LTV/CAC、回收期</td>\n<td>进入/退出决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>这个市场的运营在改善吗</td>\n<td>同市场同渠道的 CLV 与 CAC 同比</td>\n<td>运营质量评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钱应该从哪搬到哪</td>\n<td>各市场边际 CAC（每多花一元带来的人群 CLV 增量）</td>\n<td>预算再分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个问题最容易被忽略但价值最高：<strong>决定预算迁移的是边际值而不是平均值</strong>。一个市场平均 LTV/CAC 很高，但边际 CAC 已经抬升到 CLV 之下，继续加钱就是亏的；另一个市场平均比值平平，但边际 CAC 还很低，就是应该加钱的地方。平均值用于判断「要不要留在这个市场」，边际值用于判断「这个月的预算该怎么调」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨境 CLV 必须在通用公式之上加三层修正：币种归一、成本侵蚀、分母构造。跳过任何一层结论都站不住。</li>\n<li>币种归一用日终中间价、逐笔按发生日折算；金额以整数最小单位存储，绝不用浮点。结算币种与市场币种不一致时产生的汇兑损益要显式记录。</li>\n<li>四道成本侵蚀（退货与逆向物流、关税与 VAT、支付与换汇、履约时效的隐性折损）叠加后，同一商品在不同市场的净贡献率可以相差一倍以上。退货成本必须按客户建模而非按市场取均值。</li>\n<li>CAC 必须分市场分渠道计算，分母用新客数且新客定义与生命周期分群口径一致；首次订单 CPA 不能代替 CAC。</li>\n<li>LTV/CAC 用于战略取舍，回收期用于现金流约束；跨境业务的现金周期更长，回收期容忍度应比本土更保守。</li>\n<li>跨市场对标看三个层次的问题；预算再分配的依据是<strong>边际 CAC</strong> 而非平均比值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境多币种与获客成本调整","id":"跨境多币种与获客成本调整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：跨境 CLV 的三个修正层","id":"核心概念-跨境-clv-的三个修正层"},{"level":2,"text":"第一层：币种归一的时点与类型选择","id":"第一层-币种归一的时点与类型选择"},{"level":2,"text":"第二层：成本侵蚀修正——跨境 CLV 与本土 CLV 最大的区别","id":"第二层-成本侵蚀修正-跨境-clv-与本土-clv-最大的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"第三层：分市场 CAC 与回收期","id":"第三层-分市场-cac-与回收期"},{"level":2,"text":"跨市场对标的可行做法","id":"跨市场对标的可行做法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"BG/NBD、概率模型与 ML 预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/clv-modeling/clv-model-method"},"next":{"title":"新客/成长/成熟/衰退/流失划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/lifecycle-stage/stage-definition"}}